request: Add a clear command that removes todos whose completed field is true.

single call 1: edit -> src/types.ts, src/commands.ts, src/commands.test.ts  (Added a clear command that removes todos whose completed (done) field is true. clear() filters out done todos; parseArgs maps the "clear" argv to a new { kind: "clear" } Command variant; run() saves the filtered list and reports how many were removed (e.g. "Cleared 1 todo"). Tests cover the pure filter, the file-backed run (only done todos are removed, open ones survive), and argv parsing.)
round 1: oracle GREEN
single call 2: accept  (The clear command is implemented end to end: types.ts gains a { kind: "clear" } Command variant, commands.ts adds a pure clear() filter (keeps todos where done is false), parseArgs maps the "clear" argument, and run() persists the filtered list and reports the removed count ("Cleared N todo(s)"). New tests cover the pure function, the file-backed command (done todos removed, open todos kept), and argument parsing; all existing tests are untouched. tsc --noEmit and all 12 vitest tests pass.)

